{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】浸大發表大灣區薪酬調查報告，顯示香港企業今年的薪酬加幅為2.3%，較去年低，但預計明年回升至3.1%。究竟大灣區的職場市況如何？香港與內地城市各有何機遇？</p>\n<p>周五的時事全方位，請來學者分析。</p>\n<p>題目：大灣區薪酬與行業發展</p>\n<p>熱線電話：1833298</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T11:41:27.240050+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:29:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T11:37:43.847585+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:37:43.847585+00:00","content_hash":"307ced75bae9ab0eec2c072605127423b5f6f830cd4b76ba9845733d9875ce0b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}